1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:03,411
Tunda klinikangizda kim yurganini bilasizmi?

2
00:00:03,361 --> 00:00:13,987
Med.uz.ai Hikvision kameralari bilan ishlaydi: xodimlar davomati avtomatik, bemor kelganini kamera taniydi, tungi ogohlantirish surati rahbarning telefoniga keladi.

3
00:00:13,987 --> 00:00:17,642
Yuz rasmlari kamerada qoladi, bizda faqat vaqt.

4
00:00:17,642 --> 00:00:19,635
Xavfsiz va qonuniy.

5
00:00:19,635 --> 00:00:22,112
Bepul demo — med.uz.ai.

